window.products.push({"id":898017,"name":"armocity Storage Cabinet with 2 Doors and 5 Shelves, Bathroom Storage Cabinet with 5-Tier Shelves, Industrial Storage Cabinet for Living Room and Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkVMMWlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💙 CLASSY & INDUSTIAL STORAGE CABINET: Featuring 5-tier shelves, our storage cabinet provides you with lots of open space for your stuff, album, collection, plants, and other decorations. It also has hidden storage at the bottom, which can store your private belongings or the stuff you do not use usually, making your room more tidy and fantastic. 💙 PANTRY CABINET with DOORS: There are two stainless steel mesh doors for the bottom storage shelf, which shut and open easily with the magnet. Magnetic door catch can hold the doors in place and closed securely. This floor cabinet is a nice addition to your living room, bathroom for storage and display. It also can be placed in your kitchen for extra storage of pantry items, or in your laundry utility room to store household products. 💙 INDUSTIAL BOOKSHELF with CABINET: This adorable shelving item is a good choice for your home office area to place your books, files, printer, and other belongings. It is also good for your kids to store their toys, gifts, picture book, alarm clock. Adding it to your bedroom office for additional storage, or putting it in your spare guest bedroom will make the organization wonderful. 💙 SUITABLE SIZE for SMALL SPACE: Cute Dimensions: 23.62''(L) * 12.6''(W) * 49.22(H). Comes with adjustable feet for easy positioning wherever you want. This kitchen storage cabinet can fit well your small space and corner space. Giving you flexibility with the shelves and the cabinets below to put stuff in, this bookshelf with doors enlarges your limited space fully. 🔧 EASY to PUT TOGETHER: Pretty straightforward assembly! This floor cabinet will come with detailed and figured installation instructions and labeled parts. You can put it together in about 20 minutes easily. If you have an electric screwdriver, the installation will be a lot quicker. If you meet any issues when installing this modern storage cabinet, please just contact us. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkVMMWlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"armocity","source_asin":"B09FSLBV7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FSLBV7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FSLBV7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
