window.products.push({"id":898083,"name":"Redecker Toilet Brush Replacement Head, Made in Germany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CNgydKEpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relish the world-renowned quality of Redecker's handmade household products! Great for efficiently scrubbing toilet bowls until they sparkle, this replacement head fits Redecker toilet brushes. Brush measures 3 inches long. Made in Germany. Easy to Use The head piece easily attaches to the handle when it’s time for a change using internal threading for a secure fit. We recommend replacing the heads approximately every 2 – 3 months with heavy use. Before being strung into the brush head, the bristles are cleaned, scoured, and combed in a multi-stage process. This finishing treatment ensures the utmost quality to withstand high heat and still retain the shape well. Long-Lasting and Easy to Clean. Bristles are made from recycled PBT which is not only durable, but these plant-based fibers withstand high heat and retain their shape well over time. For maintenance, it is recommended to clean with a mild soap and warm water solution. Towel blot to remove excess moisture and hang to air dry with bristles facing down to prevent damage to wooden handle. The first handcrafted Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes were produced in 1935. A lot has changed since then. Today, the name Bürstenhaus Redecker stands as it has for many years for an ideal combination of natural quality, function, and design. It lives from the blend of inventiveness, sound craftsmanship and creativity. Handcrafted in Germany, Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes are made of domestic woods, bristles, hair, and plant fibers, and have been for decades. Precedence is given to natural, sustainable raw materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CNgydKEpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDECKER","source_asin":"B0BWMLRWZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMLRWZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMLRWZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
