window.products.push({"id":898244,"name":"holuxer Large Expandable Tactical Lunch Box for Men, Durable Insulated Leakproof Lunch Bag, Heavy Duty Cooler Bag for Work Outdoor Picnic Travel Offic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0pZ7Z7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE LAYER LARGE CAPACITY -- Maximum size is 15L, fits 24 cans of cola(330ml). Designed with 2 compartments, which can separate dry and wet. The upper storage space is expandable, increasing the capacity by 4L. 2 mesh side pockets, 2 front pockets, and 1 mesh inner pocket, providing more storage space for you to go out, handy to use for work, outings, construction, picnic, camping, day trips, and so on. TACTICAL DESIGN -- The design of this tactical lunch bag combines outdoor and tactical elements and is very sturdy. Velcro on the front, you can attach personalized stickers such as the flag Velcro. The webbing strap on the back can for hanging storage carabiners, keys, sunglasses, etc. The adjustable &detachable shoulder strap makes your carrying more comfortable and convenient. Especially suitable for drivers, soldiers, construction workers, athletes, and more. EXCELLENT INSULATION PERFORMANCE -- Our insulation lunch box is lined with high-quality aluminum foil and filled with a 6mm thick insulation foam inside. With a multi-layer insulation design, it has good keep-warm & cold performance, which ensures the fresh taste and health of food. There are also a variety of colors to choose from, making it the perfect gift for your husband, father, boyfriend, birthday, Christmas, etc. WATER-RESISTANT AND LEAK-PROOF -- This cooler bag consists of high-quality materials with a three-dimensional appearance. The outer layer of wear/water-resistant oxford cloth is solid and durable, for protecting your lunch and stuff inside from dust or rain. The interior has thickened aluminum foil lining, that can withstand temperatures up to 248 degrees Fahrenheit, you can put the heated food directly into it, and is easy to clean. With heat-press seam technology, is better for leak-proof. WARRANTY AND SERVICE -- 365 days warranty service policy commitments. We care deeply about your experience, if you have any questions about our products, please contact us through \"Contact Seller\" on Amazon, and we will reply to you within 24 hours and give you a good solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0pZ7Z7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"holuxer","source_asin":"B0BMMR5S8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMMR5S8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMMR5S8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":898245,"name":"Picture Frames Set of 4 - 4x6 and 5x7 Wall Decor in 2 Different Sizes - Wooden Designs Table Top & Wall Mount Photo Frames Sets for Wall - Vertical & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hVj1qO2VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 home décor assorted picture frames in a wooden design. The frames included are sizes 4” x 6” and 5” x 7”. They are suitable for both table top standing and wall mounting. Each frame has a different and unique high quality design. The designs are rustic wood, stars, leaves and barks. Together they create a desirable set of frames for a picture frame collage. VERSATILE ROOM DÉCOR This set of photo frames comes with hanging hardware so they can be easily hung on the wall. Also, they each have an easel back, and can be hung or stood both vertically and horizontally. This makes them incredibly versatile and you can customise the layout of these frames to your home! STAND THE TEST OF TIME The picture frame set will stand the test of time because they are made from durable MDF and real glass. There is a noticeable difference between these and the cheap and flimsy plastic frames on the market. The easy open backing makes it super simple to load, swap, and display your photos. Have them ready and displayed in seconds! BEAUTIFUL DESIGN EVERY TIME The artwork on these frames is created using laser precision. This means the elegant design and exquisite craftsmanship is guaranteed on every frame. With a mix of neutral tones such as blue, white, and beige the picture frames complement and enhance your home. They will fit in seamlessly with your existing color scheme. GIVE THE GIFT OF MEMORIES Show your friends, family, mom or dad how much you care with these photo frames! The colors of the frames are complementary in every home. You could fill these frames with cute memories of the past so your loved ones could be reminded every day. They also make excellent anniversary, wedding, birthday and housewarming gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hVj1qO2VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ohana Avenue","source_asin":"B07TBD4DG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TBD4DG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TBD4DG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
