window.products.push({"id":898463,"name":"Butofinus 5 Pairs Large Size Rug Gripper, Hook and Loop Anti Slip Rug Corner Grips, Washable Area Carpet Rug Tape Pad, Reusable Stickers for Hardwood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tUsI7Zb+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exclusive Patent Approved Universal Rug Gripper】：Designed with advanced hook and loop fastening technology and Velcro material for reusability. Our 4+1 set can fix the carpet perfectly. The new triangular design can fit the carpet better and the cross shape design can prevent the middle bulge. Our rug gripper prevent slip and fall accidents and properly address annoying carpet problems such as curling, sliding and folding, providing a good and safe environment for family, friends and pets. 【Easy to Remove Without Leaving A Trace, No Damage to the Carpet】: Unlike traditional disposable double-sided carpet tape, our rug gripper are removable and can be taped and peeled off over and over again, which is quite eco-friendly. You can also easily remove it when you don't want to use it. It will not damage your carpet or leave marks on the floor. 【Lasting Ddhesive & Widely Applicable】：Rug gripper uses a super strong adhesive. Once secured to the floor and carpet, it sticks firmly and will not come off easily. The larger contact surface provides more effective adhesion and excellent non-slip grip on carpet. Our hook and loop carpet corner clamps are suitable for a wide range of hard floors and the rug gripper are large enough to fit many sizes of carpet. 【Washable & Reusable】：Our carpet tape is made of Velcro material and can be reused. The black sticky hair in the middle and the corresponding sticky side are made of high quality material. After use, you can take the sticky side on the carpet to the washing machine and wash it without losing the stickiness afterwards. The sticky side on the floor can be swept and mopped with a cleaning tool. After this operation, the product can still be used. 【Easy Install】：You get 5 carpet grips with purchase, 4 + 1 combination can be applied to large carpets. Peel off the white backing paper, (you can clean the bottom of the carpet edges first to get better adhesion) stick it on the carpet and press firmly. Then do the same to peel off the back tape and stick it on the floor and press it firmly, you are ready to use, the velcro can be peeled off and put on at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tUsI7Zb+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butofinus","source_asin":"B0BMV2H7XH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMV2H7XH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMV2H7XH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
