window.products.push({"id":898502,"name":"Stainless Steel Adjustable Mandoline Slicer Kitchen Tool for Slicing Tomato Potato Fruits Vegetables and other Food SS Cheese Grater & Citrus Zester G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pVzfJmOeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥕DAIKOKU MANDOLINE FOOD SLICER SET will let you to get 0 - 0.35 Inch slices of cheese, vegetables, onion, tomatoes, fruits and other food. Daikoku kitchen slicer has improved design and made of superior materials, also our set includes Cheese/Citrus Grater that will last you for many years and will make the cooking process more convenient and easy. Using of our slicer set will help you to save a lot of time and energy. 🍅CUTTING MODE BUTTON is made to give you to choose the slice thickness you need. The turning of the button will let you to choose the cutting mode (Slice or Julienne) and the size of cutting. Julienne mode has 4.5mm - 9mm (0.17-0.35 Inch) cutting sizes, slice mode has paper thin (0.04 Inch), 3mm (0.12 Inch), 6mm (0.24 Inch), and 9mm (0.35 Inch) cutting sizes. So you can forget about the knife during the cutting process to get perfect slices. 🧀STAINLESS STEEL CITRUS ZESTER & CHEESE GRATER is a hand held appliance that will let you to grate cheese, chocolate, coconut, lemon or orange zest for cooking salads, pizza, Italian, Mexican, Chinese, japan food. You will have an ability try to cook something new that you have never been cooked before. It has convenient handle for hands protection and storage. Both the food slicer and cheese grater can be cleaned in dishwasher. 🍆A LOT OF INCLUDED. Besides of cheese/citrus grater our set includes a pair of thick, flexible safety gloves for effective protection from accidental nicks and cuts. In addition, our set includes hand holder for vegetable that will keep your hands and fingers from getting near the slicing blades. You will get a detailed instruction manual with clear directions of how to get the best results in the right away. Therefore, our slicer set is 100% ready for safe using. 🎁GREAT GIFT IDEA for the person who likes cooking and enjoy this process. Daikoku mandolin slicer set will be good birthday gift, holiday present and ideal for Christmas. We can say with complete confidence that this kitchen utensil will not be superfluous at the kitchen of such a person and he or she will be able to delight his loved ones, family and friends with delicious food. We are confident that the gift recipient will be sincerely pleased.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pVzfJmOeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daikoku","source_asin":"B08HZCR6HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HZCR6HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HZCR6HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
