window.products.push({"id":898508,"name":"LUCKBOOSTIUM Evil Eye Horseshoe Hanging Ornament - Blue Evil Eye Charm & Horseshoe w/Crystal, Car Decor Rear View Mirror, Home Wall Ornaments, Keychai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TSKhf2ckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧿 MEANINGFUL DESIGN: Good luck and good fortune are symbols associated with the ancient practice. Throughout history, charms and decorations with eye-like symbols known as a Nazar, a shape of an eye, have been used to ward off the evil eye and stare back at the world to keep you safe. Charms such as this horseshoe remain one of the symbols of luck and good fortune. It combines the power of two protective charms into one stylish hanging ornament. 🧿 EXQUISITE & QUALITY MATERIAL: Our hanging decor combines the traditional horseshoe with the ancient evil eye. It is made in a beautiful shade of blue with evil eyes and crystals to bring out the beauty of both designs. Expertly crafted using quality materials such as alloy metal, resin, and glass to finish the exquisite charm. You'll be decorated in good fortune and safety with this stylish wall hanging that makes a great conversation starter. 🧿 FUNCTIONAL ORNAMENT: Crafted to be strong and sturdy, our evil eye hanging ornament will take you on your wildest adventures, protecting you. Hang it wherever you like as a good decoration for a car rearview mirror, a sun catcher, a window, a home, office, house garden, or use it as a keychain on your bag. Add some luck to your space with our horseshoe-shaped evil eye decorative piece! 🧿 DIMENSIONS: Our evil eye hanging ornament is a great addition to your home or any space. The dimensions of 11.6 inches x 2.95 inches are just the right size for displaying, accentuating all the beautiful details that were carefully crafted into it and adding a touch of mystical style to any space! 🧿 MAKES FOR A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our horseshoe evil eye hanging ornament is a delightful surprise for a spiritual family and friends who believe in its ancient protective and healing power. A lovely gift to share with every mother, grandma, sister, dad, and even yourself to bring luck and protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TSKhf2ckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKBOOSTIUM","source_asin":"B0B7R17BTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7R17BTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7R17BTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
