window.products.push({"id":898620,"name":"Gneiss Spice DIY Wall Hanging Magnetic Spice Rack (24 Small Jars, Silver Lids, 10x12 Stainless Plate)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":140.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-dP9yHAKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Thanks for checking out Gneiss Spice (say, \"Nice Spice\")! Spices out of reach? Keep spices in sight and you'll use them more often, dishing up flavorful food! Hexagon-shape creates a spice honeycomb and smooth bottom jars will showcase spices clearly. Strong magnets will keep jars from sliding; internal food-safe magnet cap creates a barrier between spices and magnets. Lids form an airtight lock, keeping spices fresh. Includes clear waterproof and dishwasher safe spice labels (48 spice labels set with 10 jars; 112 spice label set with 24 jars).  For most cooks, our small 1.5 oz. jars accommodate more than enough spice to be used within one year. However, when you buy refills from a grocery store, many are more than 1.5 oz volume. Buy the smallest refill size or buy spices in bulk at your local natural food store. Even better, fill your jars with our (size appropriate) refills! Jars are EMPTY , to fill with your own spices. Our specialty is creating customized spice kits personalized to your pantry. We have the best quality organic spices, guaranteed! Fresh spices and will improve your cooking. Time to clean out your pantry? Small 1.5 oz. jars measure 1.75\" wide by 2\" tall, and hold a volume just under 1/4 c. Looking for larger jars? We make magnetic jars in a 4 oz size, too. On our own fridge, we use a combo of mostly small with a few larger jars for our favorite spices.  Choose stainless steel for a modern look or our one-of-a-kind naturally rusted finish to match your shabby chic country kitchen! Medium 10x12 inch plate fits up to 28 small jars or 18 large jars. Large 12x15, 14x14 or 20x10 inch plate fits up to 50 small jars or 30 large jars.   All products are made by Gneiss Spice in our western Maine studio from materials sourced in the USA and abroad. Please contact us with all questions and check out our website for customized spice racks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-dP9yHAKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gneiss Spice","source_asin":"B01FT1ZG3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FT1ZG3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FT1ZG3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
