window.products.push({"id":898756,"name":"Glass Jar Set 12pc (6oz) with Natural Bamboo Lids, Stickers and Marker - Airtight Canister for Home Kitchen, Pantry Food Storage, Herb and Spice Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dDOXRYr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RJD’s GLASS STORAGE JAR WITH NATURAL BAMBOO LID At RJD, we strive to improve your home organization and ease of life within your household. We specialize in high quality borosilicate glass products and home goods that represent you as an individual. Our products consist of fashionable, yet functional designs that will compliment any lifestyle. Specifications: - Size & Quanity: (Set of 12 Glass Jars) - Size: 2 1/2\" x 3 1/8\", Capacity:177ml or 6oz - Natural Bamboo Lid: This glass jars lid is natural bamboo with a silicone seal. The silicone seal provides more of an airtight seal that conventional soft plastic seals or twist lids. This allows for food products to maintain a longer shelf life. - High Strength Borosilicate Glass: Made from high strength borosilicate glass – Borosilicate glass is more heat and freeze resistant than standard glass jars and can withstand temperatures from -20 degrees to 150 degrees Celsius. This makes it possible to put them in the refrigerator and microwave. - Clean with Ease: Wide mouth on the top makes it easy to clean inside and out. These jars are dishwasher-safe, but hand-washing is always recommended for glass jars. - Additional Applications : Glass Jars are perfect for storing wet or dry food, baking goods (Powder sugar Flour/Salt /Sugar/Baking powder), tea, spices and or other ingredients. They not only store and organize food well, but also saves space in the kitchen. Other applications of the jars include Wedding or Party favors, decorations, lose or small item storage (buttons/pins or sewing materials), Hardware storage (screws/nails/fasteners), ect… **100% Guarantee :At RJD, we strive to improve your home organization and ease of life within your household. Not only do we aim for perfection when it comes to the quality of our products, we aim for perfection when it comes to the service of our customers. If you are not 100% satisfied with your Glass Storage Jars, please feel free to reach out or contract us at anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dDOXRYr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homes by RJD","source_asin":"B0927322SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0927322SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0927322SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
