window.products.push({"id":898881,"name":"BRIGHT IDEAS Wax Melter, Cast Iron Skillet with Warmer and Trivet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RhD2q7xZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Bright Ideas Heavy Duty 5” Cast Iron Skillet Burner is ideal for melting wax fragrances. This is a truly unique cast iron skillet and is the perfect way to enjoy your favourite scents! The Iron Skillet Burner is an attractive addition to any home décor, perfect for country/rustic themed homes. It’s a great talking point and beautiful centrepiece! Simply place a wax melt in the skillet and light a t-lite underneath to enjoy a treat of delicious fragrance throughout your home. Wax melts not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RhD2q7xZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Ideas","source_asin":"B00113V5TU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00113V5TU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00113V5TU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":898882,"name":"Personalized Custom Pet Boxer Fleece and Sherpa Throw Blanket for Men, Women, Kids, Babies - Matching Pet Blankets Perfect for Bedtime, Bedding or as ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9Fd1WIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9Fd1WIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07S18WS76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S18WS76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S18WS76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
