window.products.push({"id":898928,"name":"10 Pack Small Digital Kitchen Timer Magnetic Countdown Up Minute Second Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vtdu+AIaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features -LCD Home Kitchen Chef Mini Countdown Digital Timer -Large screen shows correct time in minutes and seconds -3 buttons include START/STOP button, MIN button and SEC button -To reset the timer, press the Min & Sec button immediately -Magnetic band -Simple operation -The longest time is 99 minutes and 59 seconds. -Very suitable for cooking, inspection, sunbathing, etc. Specification Size: 7.0 x 5.3 x 0.8 cm Power supply: LR1130 button battery (included) How to use Positive Timing Settings Press the STOP/START button to start timing. Press any key to stop , press \"MIN\" and \"SEC\" at the same time to zero. Count down Timing Settings 1. Press \"MIN\" to set minutes; Press \"SEC\" to set seconds. 2. Press the STOP/START key to start countdown. 3. There will be buzzer sound prompt when arrive the setting time. 4. Press any key to stop the countdown, 5. Press \"MIN\" and \"SEC\" at the same time to zero. Package include 1X Digital Timer FEATURES:This Small Timer is 99 minutes 59 seconds Count down/up with memory function. LOUD ALARM:You will easily be able to hear this alarm in another room.It is loud and clear but not deafening.and if you not stop it it will Lasts 30 seconds. PLACEMENT:Stick it on the refrigerator with it's strong magnetic. QUICK SETUP:You can press the button about 1 to 2 seconds and you can set up the number quickly.Press\"M\" and \"S\" to CLEAR. HOW TO WORK:This Small timer is worked by 1 x Button Battery(included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vtdu+AIaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snzsy","source_asin":"B0768814YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-898928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0768814YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0768814YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
